# Written in the order of the GameWith Vesna team guide's Stellar Swirl
# rotations (Cryo supports, then the other supports, then Vesna's
# combo): Odette E E > Cryo Traveler E N1C Q > Nicole E > Vesna combo.
# GameWith's Stellar Swirl teams are Vesna / Odette / Cryo Traveler /
# Vodyanitsa and Vesna / Cryo Traveler / Diona / Sucrose; for the Cryo
# slots it lists Odette, the Cryo Traveler, Diona and Qiqi, and for the
# fourth slot Vodyanitsa, Faruzan, Sucrose, Lan Yan and Qiqi. No guide
# puts Nicole in a Stellar Swirl team; GameWith lists her as an ATK%
# buffer for Vesna's Anemo driver team, so she takes a support slot
# here. Cryo Traveler bursts when ready. gcsim needs a normal
# attack before the Traveler's charged attack.
# Vesna's combo as in every Vesna team (GameWith's): E [N C E]x2 Q E [N
# C E]x2, the burst when ready. With 5 Sword Essence per attack it pays
# for only four Windborne Swords even with the burst, so whenever the
# next one is not ready she keeps attacking until the fifth ends Armed
# for Action.
# Nicole's burst was dropped on 2026-10-29: its 1.9 s animation
# lengthened the cycle so that the end of Vesna's combo fell outside the
# supports' buffs (Odette's Dance Double lasts 21 s). Looped score with
# build.txt 114.1k before, 116.6k without it; the numbers above are from
# before.
active odette;
odette skill:2;
travelercryo skill, attack, charge;
if .travelercryo.burst.ready {
  travelercryo burst;
}
nicole skill;
vesna skill,
      attack, charge, skill,
      attack, charge, skill;
if .vesna.burst.ready {
  vesna burst;
}
while .vesna.armed {
  while .vesna.armed && !.vesna.skill.ready {
    vesna attack, charge;
  }
  if .vesna.armed {
    vesna skill;
  }
  if .vesna.armed {
    vesna attack, charge;
  }
}
